{"id":71333,"date":"2026-10-29T19:27:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:27:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71333"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:29:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:29:30","slug":"queiriga-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/queiriga-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"IX Queiriga Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">IX Queiriga Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>IX Queiriga Trail 2027<\/strong> (9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>4 de Abril de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida marcada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na freguesia de <strong>Queiriga<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Paiva<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Integrada nas terras altas do planalto beir\u00e3o e marcada pelo patrim\u00f3nio mineiro das antigas minas da Queiriga e pelos bosques da bacia do rio Paiva, esta prova afirmada no calend\u00e1rio regional convida os atletas a percorrer trilhos naturais de montanha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa oficial da 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o compreende tr\u00eas vertentes com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>: <strong>Trail Longo<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> de lazer, permitindo tanto a disputa competitiva em trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e caminhos florestais como o conv\u00edvio pedestre pela natureza de Vila Nova de Paiva. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio para atletas e acompanhantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o \"Os Queiriguenses\"<\/strong> em estreita liga\u00e7\u00e3o com a comunidade local de Queiriga, o evento alia a promo\u00e7\u00e3o do trail running \u00e0 hospitalidade beir\u00e3 do concelho de Vila Nova de Paiva. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14